<title>USA: BOXING-LOPEZ RETAINS WBC STRAWWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-LOPEZ RETAINS WBC STRAWWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ricardo Lopez of Mexico retained his World Boxing Council strawweight championship when he stopped South African Morgan Nduma at 55 seconds of the sixth round on Saturday.</p>
</text>
